From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PS3 Linux project <ps3@localhost>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 07:23:01 +0300
Subject: Content packages only Suggested (free packages never depend on
 non-free ones)

uqm-content, uqm-music and uqm-voice are Debian non-free (CC BY-NC-SA content). The engine is GPL and
goes to the free suites; the content stays in the licensed suite (ps3-licensed), so uqm only
Suggests it (docs/PACKAGING.md, "Game data").

diff --git a/debian/control b/debian/control
--- a/debian/control
+++ b/debian/control
@@ -21,10 +21,8 @@ Vcs-Git: https://salsa.debian.org/games-team/uqm.git
 Package: uqm
 Architecture: any
 Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
- uqm-content (>= 0.8.0),
 Replaces: uqm-content
-Recommends: uqm-music (>= 0.8)
-Suggests: uqm-voice (>= 0.8)
+Suggests: uqm-content (>= 0.8.0), uqm-music (>= 0.8), uqm-voice (>= 0.8)
 Description: The Ur-Quan Masters - An inter-galactic adventure game
  You return to Earth with a vessel built from technology discovered from an
  ancient race called the Precursors only to find it enslaved. Gather allies
